WEBVTT

00:08:29.793 --> 00:08:32.933
sufficient English and Internet connection

00:08:32.957 --> 00:08:34.549
can study with us.

00:08:34.573 --> 00:08:37.481
We don't use audio, we don't use video.

00:08:37.505 --> 00:08:39.865
Broadband is not necessary.

00:08:39.889 --> 00:08:44.468
Any student from any part of the world
with any Internet connection

00:08:44.492 --> 00:08:45.891
can study with us.

00:08:46.798 --> 00:08:48.170
We are tuition free.

00:08:49.202 --> 00:08:52.819
All we ask our students to cover
is the cost of their exams,

00:08:52.843 --> 00:08:54.922
100 dollars per exam.

00:08:55.396 --> 00:08:59.996
A full-time bachelor's degree
student taking 40 courses